WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.818
Today we will build and repeat a rhythmic pattern. Our work connects with

00:00:04.818 --> 00:00:07.304
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:10.741
Mark four beat spaces with dots on paper.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:14.997
Choose claps and thigh taps to fill the beat spaces.

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:21.131
Perform the pattern twice and check for a steady pulse. Justify a revision using

00:00:21.131 --> 00:00:22.922
evidence from another world tradition.
